{"id":"bde974325ff73b34","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-classical-extension.md","title":"固定基础模型的经典精确化","display":"df-classical-extension — 固定基础模型的经典精确化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-classical-extension","aliases":["91-df-classical-extension","91-df-classical-closure","91-df-classical-model"],"display":"df-classical-extension — 固定基础模型的经典精确化","depends_on":["[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-classical-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-classical-extension</span><span>91-df-classical-closure</span><span>91-df-classical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-extension — 固定基础模型的经典精确化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a6ae68f45ba9960\" href=\"?note=2a6ae68f45ba9960\" title=\"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction\">91-df-three-valued-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq C_T\">\\(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq C_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句子编码集；基础结构固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=\\operatorname{val}_3^{\\mathbb N,(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)}\">\\(v=\\operatorname{val}_3^{\\mathbb N,(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)}\\)</span> 是相应强 Kleene 评估；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_Y\">\\(w_Y\\)</span> 是经典结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,Y)\">\\((\\mathbb N,Y)\\)</span> 诱导的二值评估。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClExt},\\operatorname{Prec},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClExt},\\operatorname{Prec},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}\\)</span> 是下述元层集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^-\\coloneqq\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in Y\\}\">\\(Y^-\\coloneqq\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in Y\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\n\\coloneqq\\{w_Y:\\Gamma^+\\subseteq Y\\subseteq C_T,\\ Y\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\n\\coloneqq\\{w_Y:\\Gamma^+\\subseteq Y\\subseteq C_T,\\ Y\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:X\\subseteq Y,\\ Y\\cap Y^-=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:X\\subseteq Y,\\ Y\\cap Y^-=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一类补全真理原子的未定信息，保持基础算术和全部递归语义；结构归纳说明它保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 每个已定值。它非空，因为可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\Gamma^+\">\\(Y=\\Gamma^+\\)</span>。不能逐句独立决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。\n第二类另要求扩张的编码集自身不同时收取一句及其否定，是 Cantini VF 所用 VC 精确化。它不同于只避开原来反外延的第一类；不能把所有超赋值方案都称为同一种 VF 语义。\nVC 中“集合一致”只是上述信息条件，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 作为理论在经典演绎下闭合。</p>\n<p>来源：第 18 章，印刷页 250–251，PDF 页 261–262；VC 变体补充核对 Dopico–Hayashi 2024 §2.2（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.12471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.12471</a>）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-three-valued-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^+\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"C_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"v=\\operatorname{val}_3^{\\mathbb N,(\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-)}","display":false},{"tex":"w_Y","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClExt},\\operatorname{Prec},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}","display":false},{"tex":"Y^-\\coloneqq\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ClExt}(v)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\n\\coloneqq\\{w_Y:\\Gamma^+\\subseteq Y\\subseteq C_T,\\ Y\\cap\\Gamma^-=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:X\\subseteq Y,\\ Y\\cap Y^-=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"Y=\\Gamma^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":1995,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$v$ 为 [[91-df-classical-extension]] 的标准部分评估；\n$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)$\n是指定的允许精确化类。"},{"id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-classical-extension]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df